---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
    <section class="pt-40 pb-32 px-6">
        <div class="container-tight max-w-3xl !px-0">
            <h1
                class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-12"
            >
                Privacy Policy.
            </h1>
            <div class="space-y-10 text-zinc-500 font-medium leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    Last updated: {
                        new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", {
                            month: "long",
                            day: "numeric",
                            year: "numeric",
                        })
                    }
                </p>
                <p>
                    This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, process,
                    and disclose your personal information, in conjunction with
                    your access to and use of the AZAP platform and services.
                </p>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">
                        1. Information We Collect
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        We collect three main categories of information:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                        <li>
                            <strong>Information You Provide:</strong> Account information
                            (name, email, phone number), profile details, physical
                            addresses for service delivery, and payment information.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Information Automatically Collected:</strong
                            > Device information, IP addresses, log data, and usage
                            statistics when you interact with our platform.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Location and Verification Data:</strong> We collect
                            precise geolocation data and timestamp logs during the
                            PINCode verification process to ensure service quality
                            and security.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">
                        2. How We Use Your Information
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mb-3">We use the collected information to:</p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                        <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our services.</li>
                        <li>
                            Match you with vetted home service professionals.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Process transactions and send related information,
                            including confirmations and receipts.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Send technical notices, updates, security alerts,
                            and support messages.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Respond to your comments, questions, and customer
                            service requests.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">
                        3. Sharing of Information
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        We do not sell your personal data. We may share your
                        information in the following circumstances:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                        <li>
                            <strong>With Service Providers:</strong> We share your
                            necessary details (such as address and service requirements)
                            with the independent professionals booked for your tasks.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>For Legal Reasons:</strong> We may disclose information
                            if we believe it is necessary to comply with applicable
                            laws, regulations, or legal processes.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In connection with
                            any merger, sale of company assets, or acquisition of
                            all or a portion of our business.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">
                        4. Data Security & Retention
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We implement robust security measures to protect your
                        personal information from unauthorized access,
                        alteration, disclosure, or destruction. We retain your
                        personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill
                        the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy, unless a
                        longer retention period is required by law.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">
                        5. Your Privacy Rights
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right
                        to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your
                        personal data. You may also have the right to object to
                        or restrict certain processing of your data. To exercise
                        these rights, please contact our support team.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">
                        6. Cookies and Tracking
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to
                        track activity on our platform and hold certain
                        information. You can instruct your browser to refuse all
                        cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">
                        7. Changes to This Policy
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We
                        will notify you of any changes by posting the new
                        Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last
                        updated" date at the top.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">
                        8. Contact Us
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy,
                        please contact us at <a
                            href="mailto:admin@getazap.com"
                            class="text-accent font-bold hover:underline"
                            >admin@getazap.com</a
                        > or via our Contact page.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
